---
title: "get_linked_referral_code (protocol::referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check: self, user
    q_check --> q_return_some: self.referee_to_code.contains(user)
    q_check --> q_return_none: !self.referee_to_code.contains(user)
    q_return_some --> [*]: return some(*self.referee_to_code.borrow(user))
    q_return_none --> [*]: return none()

    note right of q_check
        INV-001: Returns Some(code) if user has a linked referral code
        INV-002: Returns None if user has no linked referral code
    end note
